\f1\b0 \cf0 I have worked with software development about 25 years, since 2000. First half I worked with C and C++ development mostly with embedded systems. The later half I have worked with web-systems. Initially this was done in Javascript, NodeJS, ExpressJS, HTML and CSS and later Typescript, NodeJS, NestJS, ReactJS and styled components.\
Source code is usually stored in git with GitLab or GitHub on top to help collaborate. Connected to that CI and CD pipelines help build, run tests and deploy. Software is packaged in NPM and Docker containers and run in Kubernetes. Issue tracking and documentation is often in Jira and Confluence.\
Work-processes are normally iterative, Kanban or Scrum. I am used to work partly remote since 10 years. I can work alone but prefer a small team with skilled colleges. \
Lately AI and Copilot has become a part of my work to investigate, try things out and generate code. I have tried Spec kit as well to generate whole systems. 
